    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d782">

                <pb facs="0752" n="636" sameAs="frus:frus1915/pg636"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 882.51/641.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Messrs. Kuhn, Loeb and Company to the Secretary of
                        State</hi>.</head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">New York</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1915-01-21">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">January 21, 1915</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>We have the honor to acknowledge receipt of your telegram and we have again
                    communicated with the National City Bank, the fiscal agents for the Liberian
                    loan, who inform us that they have taken up this question with their attorneys,
                    Messrs. Sherman and Sterling, who will communicate direct with your
                    Department.</p>
                <closer>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Kuhn, Loeb and Company.</hi>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
